<title>THAILAND: Italian-Thai pays 2 baht div for 1996.</title>
<headline>Italian-Thai pays 2 baht div for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.00   vs    3.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 9, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 30, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Italian-Thai Development Plc is major heavy construction contracting firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
